cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "imputation-methods: A unified pandas API for missing-data imputation"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that implements 42 missing-data imputation methods
  (statistical, time-series, nearest-neighbor, regression, iterative,
  matrix-completion, neural and ensemble) behind a single pandas DataFrame
  interface, with metrics for evaluating imputations.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DiogoRibeiro7/imputation-methods"
url: "https://diogoribeiro7.github.io/imputation-methods/"
keywords:
  - imputation
  - missing data
  - pandas
  - scikit-learn
  - time series
  - statistics
